WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.861 --> 00:00:10.208
Choose a shape and tap each wall to measure it.

2
00:00:10.708 --> 00:00:26.794
With "Draw walls" you place the corners yourself.

3
00:00:27.294 --> 00:00:35.903
Place a window or door on the wall with one tap.

4
00:00:36.403 --> 00:00:42.105
Drag a window, door or object into place.

5
00:00:42.605 --> 00:00:48.320
On the right you see what you have selected and can adjust the sizes.

6
00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:55.122
Use "Undo" to go back one step.

